"acceptedAnswers":["is"],"options":[]},{"number":2,"prompt":"TikTok has only been in existence ____ a short time.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["for"],"options":[]},{"number":3,"prompt":"Nevertheless, it ____ already become incredibly successful.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["has"],"options":[]},{"number":4,"prompt":"The number of times people ____ downloaded the app now measures in the billions.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["have"],"options":[]},{"number":5,"prompt":"Up to now, the majority of TikTok users have ____ teenagers.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["been"],"options":[]},{"number":6,"prompt":"Statistics suggest, however, that these teenagers ____ continuing to use it into their twenties.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["are"],"options":[]},{"number":7,"prompt":"In other words, they have ____ grown out of it as we might expect.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["not"],"options":[]},{"number":8,"prompt":"Social media have been about keeping in touch with others or belonging to a community ____ the beginning.","questionType":"typed_short_answer","acceptedAnswers":["since/from","since","from"],"options":[]}]},{"stableNormalizedId":"ultimate-b2-sb-u1-p5-o2","partNumber":5,"printedPage":12,"title":"Listening · Exercise 2","instructions":"Read and answer the questions.","implementationMode":"unscored-practice","activityType":"unscored_practice","questions":[{"number":1,"prompt":"You hear two people discussing television today. What do they agree about?","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["TV is more entertaining than it was in the past.","Today’s viewers access TV in different ways.","The quality of programmes has become poorer."]}]},{"stableNormalizedId":"ultimate-b2-sb-u1-p5-o3","partNumber":5,"printedPage":12,"title":"Listening · Exercise 3","instructions":"Listen and read the text f