 task?","questionType":"long_text","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":[]},{"number":2,"prompt":"In which paragraph does the writer answer two questions?","questionType":"long_text","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":[]},{"number":3,"prompt":"What are the functions of paragraphs 1–4? Write the correct numbers.","questionType":"long_text","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":[]}]},{"stableNormalizedId":"ultimate-b2-sb-u1-p7-o5","partNumber":7,"printedPage":14,"title":"Writing · Exercise 4","instructions":"Decide if these phrases are used to begin or end emails. Write B (begin) or E (end). Then tick the informal phrases.","implementationMode":"unscored-practice","activityType":"unscored_practice","questions":[{"number":1,"prompt":"Bye for now!","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":2,"prompt":"Dear Mr Darcy,","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":3,"prompt":"Yours faithfully,","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":4,"prompt":"I look forward to hearing from you.","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":5,"prompt":"Give my love to everyone.","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":6,"prompt":"Hi Leo,","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":7,"prompt":"I am writing with regard to ...","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":8,"prompt":"Dear Sir/Madam,","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAnswers":[],"options":["B (begin)","E (end)","Informal phrase"]},{"number":9,"prompt":"Well, that’s all for now.","questionType":"multiple_choice","acceptedAns